  "goodToKnow": "Die Hemmschwelle is the inner barrier that keeps you from doing something, whether approaching strangers or seeing a doctor. The usual phrases are die Hemmschwelle überwinden (to overcome it) and die Hemmschwelle senken (to lower it), which marketing and social campaigns use a lot. Schwelle means doorstep, threshold, and also a railway sleeper. Plural: die Hemmschwellen."
